SUMMARY

The DECchip 21071 and the DECchip 21072 chip sets and the EB64+
evaluation kit met their project goals by helping to proliferate
the Alpha AXP architecture in the PC market. Several customers,
as well as some groups within Digital, use the chip sets in their
systems today. Many of these customers and internal groups have
used the EB64+ platform as a basis for their designs and as a
means of initiating their software development while they were
developing their hardware. The EB64+ platform has also been used
to develop device drivers for several PCI devices developed by
Digital.

