adds support for new DEChub modules, including:

o  PEswitch 900T
o  DECbrouter 90v2
o  DECswitch 900EE/900EF
o  GIGAswitch FGL4
o  DECrepeater 90TS
o  RoamAbout Access Point

HUBwatch for OpenVMS VAX software can be installed with POLYCENTER for
OpenVMS VAX software or standalone but requires TCP/IP Services for OpenVMS
systems in either instance. HUBwatch for OpenVMS VAX software is LMF
compliant.

HUBwatch for DEC OSF/1 AXP V3.1 (SPD 46.65)

This is the first release of HUBwatch on the DEC OSF/1 AXP platform. It is
being released at V3.1 to represent the identical functionality to the
OpenVMS VAX software. This is a direct port of the OpenVMS VAX software.
HUBwatch for DEC OSF/1 AXP software can be installed to run standalone, or
to be launched from POLYCENTER NetView software. This product is LMF
compliant.

DEChub Consolidated Firmware Kits

These V3.1 kits are now available on OpenVMS VAX, MS-DOS, and DEC OSF/1 AXP
platforms. They contain the latest DEChub firmware and the DECnduPlus Load
Utility. This firmware is required to run HUBwatch V3.1. These kits are also
included in the HUBwatch Media Kit.

