HUBwatch V3.1 provides multiplatform support, ease of installation and use,
and very competitive pricing. It provides additional functionality for
managing DEChubs, as well as graphical SNMP management of GIGAswitch devices
from the OpenVMS VAX and DEC OSF/1 AXP platforms.

HUBwatch for Windows is a very cost effective hub manager. It provides
complete LAN management, including FDDI, Personal Ethernet, and Ethernet to
