a layered product on POLYCENTER Manager on NetView software. The POLYCENTER
DECnet Manager product consists of network management applications to manage
DECnet Phase IV using Network Control Program (NCP), DECnet/OSI using
Network Command Language (NCL), Digital's LAN bridges using Remote Bridge
Management Software (RBMS), and Digital's terminal servers using Console
Carrier Request (CCR).

