management software tool. It assists users in evaluating the health and
performance of Internet Protocol (IP) routing paths between specified TCP/IP
address pairs. Pathdoctor is particularly adept at determining routing
problems and inefficiencies for Cisco, Wellfleet, 3Com, Proteon, Digital,
